{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter this 3D action-adventure world that will test your daring, strategy and reflexes! In this fast-paced journey, you take on the role of a fearless chicken on a mission to protect his faithful companion, Chick, from the persistent bees who are chasing him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/70de6d74fce0c2648900a64ae529f85f.poster.avif?t=1746611006\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/70de6d74fce0c2648900a64ae529f85f.webm?t=1746611006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the clock!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 25 seconds to reach a key. Strategize and figure out how to collect all the keys before time runs out. Can you do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect Chick!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feathered friend is counting on you. Throw the shield at him when needed. Defend him from the bee attacks and keep his precious life intact. Every collision is a test of your skill \u2013 are you ready to be the hero he needs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive visuals and sound!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although in 3D, the game features 2D explosion effects to give the player a fun cartoon feel every time a bee is blown up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/c87b8c0bc18368e73d30d49891c65e07.poster.avif?t=1746611006\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/c87b8c0bc18368e73d30d49891c65e07.webm?t=1746611006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/c87b8c0bc18368e73d30d49891c65e07.mp4?t=1746611006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the adventure now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download <i>Chick Defender</i> and embark on a journey where every key is a step towards victory, every bee is a challenge to overcome and every round is a test of your bravery. Do you have what it takes to save Chick and show that you can reach higher and higher rounds? Prove it!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Full Key Cycle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655200/a817224208543b85cf468e369dab0292e5f25f16.jpg"},{"name":"Helper!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655200/7322f54d6e0a68aa15f256155b5f3abea760a418.jpg"},{"name":"Helper Cannon!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655200/840ce210fd1f666f6f967021d6d2d4a6f7e7d063.jpg"},{"name":"Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655200/e24c059e43a0588e24719e6120e15253ecb7fe73.jpg"},{"name":"Impossible!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655200/b36505945ec6a46a694eee7345a79c0b34093c2e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655200?t=1746611006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/13ca9b5f0a27d582993f8e2f1e1633ccc61acdb5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746611006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/736cf8d270a8bd7058a9a24555b8d9878920ed1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746611006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/736cf8d270a8bd7058a9a24555b8d9878920ed1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746611006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter this 3D action-adventure world that will test your daring, strategy and reflexes! In this fast-paced journey, you take on the role of a fearless chicken on a mission to protect his faithful companion, Chick, from the persistent bees who are chasing him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/70de6d74fce0c2648900a64ae529f85f.poster.avif?t=1746611006\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/70de6d74fce0c2648900a64ae529f85f.webm?t=1746611006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the clock!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 25 seconds to reach a key. Strategize and figure out how to collect all the keys before time runs out. Can you do it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect Chick!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feathered friend is counting on you. Throw the shield at him when needed. Defend him from the bee attacks and keep his precious life intact. Every collision is a test of your skill \u2013 are you ready to be the hero he needs?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive visuals and sound!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although in 3D, the game features 2D explosion effects to give the player a fun cartoon feel every time a bee is blown up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/c87b8c0bc18368e73d30d49891c65e07.poster.avif?t=1746611006\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/c87b8c0bc18368e73d30d49891c65e07.webm?t=1746611006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/extras/c87b8c0bc18368e73d30d49891c65e07.mp4?t=1746611006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the adventure now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download <i>Chick Defender</i> and embark on a journey where every key is a step towards victory, every bee is a challenge to overcome and every round is a test of your bravery. Do you have what it takes to save Chick and show that you can reach higher and higher rounds? Prove it!</p>","developers":["Igarashi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655200/bd21d6133f7e30155d215b3a0aa1d0f0af95aaa3/header.jpg?t=1746611006","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3655200/868435/1a6be4b9808287d8be19de1af787419ca3e37309/1750415764/dash_av1.mpd?t=174584393